{"product_id":"trumps-christmas-carol-god-help-us-everyone","title":"Trump's Christmas Carol: God Help Us, Everyone!","description":"\u003cp\u003ePresident Ebenezer Trump, a rich old fool whose heart is as small as his hands and whose words are as false as his hair, sits shut up alone in the White House on Christmas Eve. But he is confronted that night by the ghost of Richard Nixon, who warns him that he will be visited by three spirits, all intent on changing his imprudent and miserly ways. He meets the jovial Ghost of Christmas Past, Bill Clinton, full of fun tales and memories; the spirit who everyone wishes was still the Ghost of Christmas Present, Barack Obama; and the terrifying Ghost of Christmas Yet to Come, who shows him how abolishing Obamacare will finish off Tiny Tim. But will Trump heed their advice, and become a good person?\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:15 x 229  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Lucien Young \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781785037863 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: hardcover \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 112\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43548327510169,"sku":"13RA9781785037863","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/c481b7b9e6dd9db6b75f64837ee28812.jpg?v=1698909953","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/trumps-christmas-carol-god-help-us-everyone","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}